{"book":24,"chapter":7,"context":{"chapter":7,"title":"The Temple Sermon","summary":"At the temple gate Jeremiah warns worshipers not to trust the slogan 'The temple of the Lord' while they steal, murder and worship Baal, or God will do to this house what He did to Shiloh. He also condemns offerings to the 'queen of heaven' and child sacrifice.","background":"Shiloh, where the tabernacle stood in Eli's day, lost its place after the Philistines captured the ark (1 Samuel 4; Psalm 78:60). Chapter 26 tells of the uproar this sermon caused early in Jehoiakim's reign. The 'queen of heaven' (v. 18) was probably a goddess such as Ishtar or Astarte, honored with baked cakes.","customs":[{"term":"Tophet in the valley of Hinnom","verses":"7:31-32","note":"A site south of Jerusalem where children were burned as offerings. The name Gehenna, which Jesus used for hell, comes from the Hebrew ge hinnom, 'valley of Hinnom.'"}],"watchFor":["'The temple of the Lord' three times (v. 4).","'A den of robbers' (v. 11), quoted by Jesus in Matthew 21:13.","'Pray not thou for this people' (v. 16)."],"connections":["Jeremiah 26:1-6","Matthew 21:13","1 Samuel 4:3-11","Psalms 78:60"]},"verses":{"1":{"w":[["הַדָּבָר","hadavar","H1697","HTd/Ncmsa","the word"],["אֲשֶׁר","'asher","H834","HTr","which"],["הָיָה","hayah","H1961","HVqp3ms","it came"],["אֶל","'el-","H413","HR","to"],["יִרְמְיָהוּ","yirmeyahu","H3414","HNpm","Jeremiah"],["מֵאֵת","me'et","H854","HR/R","from with"],["יְהוָה","yahweh","H3068","HNpt","Yahweh"],["לֵאמֹר","lemor","H559","HR/Vqcc","<to> saying"]]},"2":{"w":[["עֲמֹד","'amod","H5975","HVqv2ms","stand"],["בְּשַׁעַר","besha'ar","H8179","HR/Ncmsc","in [the] gate of"],["בֵּית","beit","H1004","HNcmsc","[the] house of"],["יְהוָה","yahweh","H3068","HNpt","Yahweh"],["וְקָרָאתָ","vekarata","H7121","Hc/Vqq2ms","and you will proclaim"],["שָּׁם","sham","H8033","HD","there"],["אֶת","'et-","H853","HTo","<obj.>"],["הַדָּבָר","hadavar","H1697","HTd/Ncmsa","the word"],["הַזֶּה","hazeh","H2088","H